10) TEST BACKEND FAILURE
------------------------
# On Backend1:
sudo systemctl stop nginx

# From the client/load balancer:
curl -i http://LOAD_BALANCER_IP:8080

# Restore Backend1:
sudo systemctl start nginx

NOTE: This is application-level load balancing, not automatic VM failover.

