LIMITATIONS
-----------
- VMware Workstation Pro is the outer Type 2 hypervisor.
- KVM inside Ubuntu is a nested hypervisor, only when supported.
- Installing KVM on two VMs does not automatically create a cluster.
- Workstation does not provide native vSphere HA/DRS/vMotion.
- Nginx balances application requests; it does not restart failed VMs.
- Do not run static-IP examples until you verify the real VMware subnet.
